# Fatal Fissure: Bot1 chooses Bot2's Elvish Mystic and then kills it with Lightning Bolt in response. The spell's only target is gone, so it
# does not resolve (CR 608.2b): no delayed ability is created, nothing is asked and no land becomes a creature.

